	Attention((1, 0, 0, 1), (1, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 1), (3, 4, 7, 8, 5, 6, 5, 6), 1, 1, 2, 2)
Paired(pairValues Numbers, masked Boolean) Attention
